│ restricted to English-speaking CIS callers 50\xa0+\xa0years of age, who would be eligible for CRC screening at 14    │
│ months follow-up and did not call the CIS about CRC or CRC screening. Four experimental conditions were compared: a  │
│ single untailored (SU) mailout of print material (the control condition); a single tailored (ST) mailout of print    │
│ material; four (multiple) tailored (MT) mailouts of print materials spanning 12 months, all of which were tailored   │
