  screening behaviors needs to be tested with a larger number of women and over a longer time period.Wiley Online       
  Library"}, {"study_index": 26, "title": "Improving risk communication", "abstract": "This paper explores reasons for  
  difficulties in communicating risks among analysts, the laypublic, media, and regulators. Formulating risk            
