Thought: I need to screen 20 studies (indices 41-60) against the selection criteria for a systematic review about       
personalised risk communication for informed decision making about screening tests. The selection criteria require: (1) 
Randomised controlled trials, (2) intervention with personalised risk communication element, (3) for individuals        
