│ 77, 78, 79, 80], "studies": [{"study_index": 61, "title": "Reaching targets in the national cervical screening       │
│ programme: are current practices unethical?", "abstract": "The principle of informed consent is now well established │
│ within the National Health Service (NHS) in relation to any type of medical treatment. However, this ethical         │
│ principle appears to be far less well established in relation to medical screening programmes such as Britain's      │
│ national cervical screening programme. This article will critically examine the case for health care providers       │
